    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<h4>Exceptions</h4>",
      "tail": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<p>Any exception of the type determined by the associated ErrorDomain as defined in <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_10953\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_10953]</a></p>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"notes\"><b>Hinweise:</b> This function shall not participate in overload resolution when C++ exceptions are disabled in the compiler toolchain. Behaves as if this-&gt;Domain().ThrowAsException(*this).</div>",
      "tail": "\n"
    }
